    "text": "Regnante in perpetuum domino nostro Ihesu Christo.\nRicsiendum urum Dryhtne h\u00e6lendum Criste in ecnisse \u00f0\u00e6m hiehstan & \u00f0\u00e6m untosprecendlican ealra\nFor\u00feon ic \u00c6\u00feelbreht mid Godes gife Westsaxna kyning, wito\u00f0lice ic \u00feence & me on gemynde is mid\nFor\u00feon ic cu\u00felice mid ge\u00f0eahte & mid ge\u00f0afonge & leafe minre biscepa & \u00e6ldormanna & nohte \u00feon\n\u00de\u00e6t hit sy f\u00e6stlice & unanwended & ecelice gefreod alra cynelicra & alra domlicra \u00feeowdoma ge\nGyf hwa \u00feonne sye \u00fe\u00e6t he hine for Godes lufan to \u00fean geea\u00f0medan wille \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feas ure gyfe geieacnan\nGyf \u00feanne hwilc man to \u00fean ge\u00feristl\u00e6ce o\u00f0\u00f0e mid deofles searwum to \u00feam beswicen sye \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feis on\n\u00d0is w\u00e6s gewriten \u00fe\u00e6s g\u00e6re \u00fee w\u00e6s agan fram Cristes acennednesse eahta hund wintra & feower &\n\u00deis w\u00e6s gedon in \u00feam cynelican setle on \u00fe\u00e6re stowe \u00f0e is gen\u00e6mned Dornwaraceaster beforan \u00feissum\nIc \u00c6\u00feelbreht cyning mid \u00fe\u00e6re halgan rode tacne \u00feis het swi\u00fee geornlice getrymman & gef\u00e6stnian.\n\u00dea \u00e6fter \u00feyssum hit gelamp \u00fean ilcan geare \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00feis on midne winter w\u00e6s gedon \u00fe\u00e6t \u00c6\u00feelbreht se\nFor hine selfne lifigende & for his twegen bro\u00fere \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea andwearde stodon & for hyra ealra f\u00e6der\nHe \u00feisne freodom on \u00e6lmihtiges Godes namon & on ealra his halgra f\u00e6stlice bebead \u00fe\u00e6t hine nan his\nAc he swa ecelice for\u00fe \u00feurhwuned\u00e6 swa lange swa God wolde \u00fe\u00e6t cristen geleafa mid Eongolcynne\n& se h\u00e6bbe Godes miltse & his halgra se \u00fee \u00feis mid Gode trymman wille & healdon.\nGyf \u00feonne hwa sie \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feis on \u00e6negum d\u00e6le wanian \u00feence o\u00f0\u00f0e brecan \u00feanne n\u00e